+# docs-triage — result
+
+Order: `projects/omegahive/orders/2026-07-28-docs-triage.md`. Repo: `omegahive`, branch
+`docs-triage` (6 commits, `823f019..5d0d733`). **Not merged and not pushed** — merging is the
+operator's act, and this clone has no remote.
+
+## What shipped
+
+**1. The triage, applied.** Fourteen surveyed docs; thirteen moved or labelled as the order
+directs, one kept in place on the order's own conservative-on-doubt rule.
+
+| Verdict | Doc | Where it is now |
+|---|---|---|
+| Reference | `omegahive_spec_1_1.md` | `docs/reference/` — labelled *reference source* |
+| Reference | `omegahive_port_spec.md` | `docs/reference/` — *shipped build spec; semantics normative, framing historical* |
+| Reference | `omegahive_stage2_verdict.md` | `docs/reference/` — *decision record; it governs, and it describes the past* |
+| Deployment record | `omegahive_remote_access_spec.md` | `docs/deployments/` — *deployment-#0 practice* |
